BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Nataraja Yoga
UID:event_314463072@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260425T031302Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T100000
SUMMARY:Outdoor Pranayama
DESCRIPTION:Nataraja School of Traditional Yoga\n**Morning Pranayama - Tra
 ditional Yogic Breathwork with Kara Weimer**\n**Tuesdays 9-10am**\n\\*\\*R
 SVP ONLY - \\*Certain injuries & health issues may be contraindicated - Pl
 ease contact me if you have a concern \\*\\*\\*\n\nStart your morning with
  traditional yogic breathwork with the added benefits of sunshine\, fresh 
 air and grounding. It is ideal to practice pranayama outside.\n\nRelease t
 oxins\, clear and align the energy channels\, strengthen the lungs\, massa
 ge\, tone & nourish internal organs\, strengthen agni & digestion\, oxygen
 ate and improve blood flow\, strengthen immunity & clear the mind. Impleme
 nt various techniques to purify\, energize\, focus & calm the mind & nervo
 us system & harness the vital life force energy - with kumbhaka & bandha (
 breath holds and internal locks). Known to increase neuroplasticity\, nitr
 ic oxide\, and erase old mental and emotional patterns. Traditionally\, pr
 anayama is the doorway to access higher states of consciousness.\n\nThroug
 hout the ongoing class different practices will be presented. Learn Cleans
 ing kriyas\, Himalayan Pranayama including including Ujjayi Variations\, H
 eating & Cooling Breaths\, Solar\, Lunar & Soli-Lunar Nadi Shuddhi practic
 es\, Samantraka Pranayama\, Mudra\, Pratyahara\, Subtle & Contemplative Pr
 actices. Includes Pranava techniques for contemplation and merging with th
 e vibration and sound of Om and Nada - internal sound current.\n\nKara is 
 a long time practitioner & teacher- trained extensively with Himalayan yog
 a adepts in ancient esoteric disciplines including advanced pranayama & mu
 dra\, using the breath as the guide for transformation and self-empowermen
 t. With deep knowledge of pranayama\, she safely guides practitioners prog
 ressively. Students must be transparent about any injuries or health conce
 rns that might be contraindicated.\n\nPlease practice on an empty stomach.
  Please bring a mat or blanket and a cushion or folded blanket to sit on. 
 Please wear layers.\nRagle Ranch Park\, Sebastopol\n$20 - Discounted Class
  Series'\, Sliding Scale Available\nContact Kara 707-235-1413\nsunyogadanc
 e@gmail.com
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/nataraja-school-of-traditional-yoga/e
 vents/314463072/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260424T195216Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260424T195216Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Nataraja Yoga
UID:event_mllfxtyjcgbnc@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260425T031302Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260430T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260430T103000
SUMMARY:Yoga Vinyasa Krama 
DESCRIPTION:Nataraja School of Traditional Yoga\n**Yoga Vinyasa Krama - Th
 ursdays 9-10:30am**\n**Songbird Community Healing Center Cotati**\n**RSVP 
 ONLY**\nExperience physical health & fitness\, pranic flow\, vital energy 
 & stillness - through intelligent architecture with the metaphysics of dee
 p conscious breathing & slow motion\, yogic breathwork\, mantra/sound/vibr
 ation\, mudra\, subtle & contemplative practices.\nYoga Vinyasa Krama is a
  comprehensive hatha-raja yogic system for purification\, developing conce
 ntration\, neuromuscular fitness and conditioning\, refining & mastering t
 he breath\, awakening subtle energy and stilling the mind. Based on deep b
 reathing & the subtle movement of prana directed into the cartilage tissue
 \, sinuous musculature\, internal organs\, nerve pathways and nadis. It ha
 s over 700 intelligently sequenced slow\, conscious breath powered with pr
 ecision movement variations with pause (vinyasas)\, exploring many aesthet
 ic variations of each posture to correctly establish the main asanas while
  the mind merges with the breath.\nIncludes the energetics of drishti\, pr
 atikriyas\, bandha\, vaseth\, mudra\, mantra\, surya & ding namaskar with 
 breath & mantra\, cleansing kriyas\, Himalayan pranayama including includi
 ng ujjayi variations\, heating & cooling breaths\, solar\, lunar & soli-lu
 nar nadi shuddhi practices\, pranava & samantraka pranayama\, pratyahara\,
  subtle & contemplative practices in 12 kramas (sequences).\nThe whole pro
 cess gradually transforms the body and mind\, releasing old patterns of ph
 ysical and mental tension and dysfunctional patterns of movement\, providi
 ng tonic\, energetic and psychophysiological effects.\nThis system is pres
 ented from the teachings **Srivatsa Ramaswami** learned through his over 3
 3 years of one on one study with **Sri Krishnamacharya** and teachings fro
 m a similar **Himalayan method**.\nThis ongoing class will explore the ent
 ire system of 12 Kramas with each class focusing on a particular krama (se
 quence) & pranayama & contemplative practices.\nPlease practice on an empt
 y stomach. Morning beverage ok but please take it 30min or more before cla
 ss.\n***Certain injuries & health issues may be contraindicated Please con
 tact me if you have a concern***\nKnowledge of Correct Ujjayi Breathing re
 commended\n**$25 Drop In\, Discounted Class Passes\, Sliding Scale Availab
 le**\n\\*\\***RSVP Only** Contact Kara @707-235-1413\, [sunyogadance@gmail
 .com](http://sunyogadance@gmail.com%2A%2A/)**om**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/nataraja-school-of-traditional-yoga/e
 vents/mllfxtyjcgbnc/
